@startuml approved-usage
title Warren — usage flow across the ten approved specs\nwarren (root) · errors · di · lifecycle · log · config · domain · app · broker · observability — approved 2026-08-01\nsources: each package's SPEC.md; warren.md §1.2–§1.5, §2.1–§2.6, §3.1, §3.2, §3.4, §7.1

actor User
participant "main.go" as main
participant "warren.App\n(root)" as app
participant "warren/di\nContainer" as di
participant "warren/lifecycle\nLifecycle" as lc
participant "adapter (edge ring)\n[not yet approved — context]" as edge
participant "warren/log\nctx logger" as log
participant "warren/app\nChain → Handler" as chain
participant "warren/broker\nPublisher/Subscriber" as broker
participant "warren/observability\nOTel wiring" as obs

== Boot — §1.3, order may not be rearranged ==
main -> app : warren.New(\n  observability.Module(...),\n  user.Module(), billing.Module(), ...)
note right : every Module is an inert value —\nnothing registers on construction
main -> app : Run()
app -> di : 1–2  flatten graph, one scope per\nmodule, copy exported bindings only
app -> di : 3  VALIDATE GRAPH → fail with the\nfull resolution chain + fix, or proceed
app -> di : 4  instantiate singletons,\ntopological order
app -> app : 5  register — route tables of\npre-built closures (Chain composed here)
app -> obs : SDK wired: exporter, sampler,\nspan per handler
app -> lc : 6  OnStart: pool → repos →\nconsumers → servers
lc -> lc : 7  readiness opens
app -> app : 8  serve

== One request — §1.4 the transport spine ==
User -> edge : POST /users
edge -> log : seed context: trace_id, span_id,\ncorrelation_id, module, handler
edge -> edge : edge middleware → decode → validate
edge -> chain : invoke(ctx, req) — typed, validated
chain -> obs : span <module>.<handler> opens
chain -> log : handler: log.FromContext(ctx).Info(...)
chain -> chain : Handle(ctx, req) —\nno net/http, no pgx, no kgo
chain --> edge : Res, or *Error with a §2.6 code
edge --> User : encoded response —\nadapter maps the code, handler never does

== The event's trip — §1.5 ==
chain -> broker : (via outbox relay)\nPublish(ctx, topic, Message{ID, Type,\nKey, Payload, Headers, OccurredAt})
obs -> broker : trace context injected\ninto Message.Headers
broker -> broker : consumer chain: Recover →\nTraceExtract → Deduplicate(inbox)
broker -> chain : new message → its handler\n(same Handler shape, same core ring)
broker -> broker : ack / nack / retry / DLQ\nby the error's §2.6 code

== Shutdown — §2.3, readiness closes FIRST ==
[o-> app : SIGTERM
app -> lc : 9  readiness → 503 — LB drains\nBEFORE anything stops
app -> lc : 10  OnStop in reverse:\nservers drain → consumers stop fetching\n→ relay flushes → pools close
lc -> lc : per-hook Timeout;\nforce-exit deadline (default 30s)
app --> main : Run() returns
@enduml
